# retroforge: enable PowerStation on release — the org.shadowblip.PowerStation service behind
# OpenGamepadUI's performance menu (CPU core count, GPU clock range; packages/powerstation).
# /etc/machine-id is empty on a fresh image so systemd runs preset-all on first boot, where the
# stock 99-default.preset is "disable *"; this higher-priority preset (60 < 99) keeps it enabled.
# A build-time multi-user.target.wants symlink ships alongside as a fallback (cf. 60-retroforge-powerd).
enable powerstation.service
